            "definition": "R. V., “Auu/m,\" **Avvites.'* 1. A tribe destroyed before the time of Moses. Deut. 2:23; Josh. 13:3. 2. A city of Beniamin, near Bethel; now Et-tell. Josh. 18:23. * 3. A tribe transported to Samaria. II Ki. 17:31."
